// Frostline: four against four across a land bridge between two oceans, the
// Precursors' climate wall down the middle of it all. West of the wall,
// red-rock desert under a clear, dry sky; east of it, Alaska: cloud piled
// against the wall, snow in the air. The wall's line is the bake's
// (`mc_map::landmark::FROSTLINE_WALL`; `tests/frostline.rs` holds the two
// together), and so is the lift that lays the canyon's beds on this map's
// lower country. Skirmish set-up can pick each region's weather, and the time
// of day.
(
    biome: Desert,
    style: Teams,
    time: Afternoon,
    strata_lift: 50,
    regions: [
        (name: "Desert", climate: Desert, weather: Clear, tweaks: (rain: 0.0, wind: 9)),
        (name: "Alaska", climate: Temperate, weather: Cloudy, tweaks: (rain: 0.7)),
    ],
    walls: [
        (line: [(4992, 0), (4992, 2400), (8192, 5600), (8192, 10784), (11392, 13984), (11392, 16384)], left: 0, right: 1),
    ],
)
